| 4:15–5:15 | Late evidence fusion (multimodal/fusion.py) — the key new component | score = visual_confidence; if text supports → +0.10; if text conflicts → -0.20; cap at 0.99. Do not let text arbitrarily override image. Output the full fusion JSON from Section 2. Ask the coding agent: 'implement this exact rule-based fusion logic returning this exact JSON shape' and hand it the contract + these rules verbatim. |  |
