| 6:15–6:45 | INTEGRATION CHECKPOINT 2 — hand fusion+confidence output to Person B for their cloud escalation call and UI |  |  |
| 6:45–7:30 | Wire Person A's whole pipeline into Streamlit tabs (Crop, Livestock) alongside Person B's shell | Person B owns the Streamlit shell; Person A plugs expert calls into it |  |
| 7:30–8:00 | End-to-end test with Person B: 4 fixed Hindi sentences, confirm 2 route local / 1–2 route cloud |  |  |

